{"version":1,"content":"<p>今晨（22日）7時許，一隻野豬在維多利亞公園出沒，在小食亭附近草地徘徊。</p><p>警方接報到場，發現該隻約1米長野豬在近天后小山丘休息，遂通知漁護署協助處理，在場警員手持盾牌戒備。</p><p>9時許，漁護署職員到場捕捉野豬。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T03:22:36.825113+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":103,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T02:42:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T04:37:44.245756+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T03:17:57.544074+00:00","content_hash":"77c7ccebb21147b530a75c94174a2e655882f006a0e676074b691f43ce5e8a07","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}